Cornerhouse on Conan provides 4-star self-catering accommodation in Moreleta Park, Pretoria East. Offering a quieter, more private alternative to larger hotels, the guesthouse gives business travellers a practical base for work and longer stays.

The property has 12 air-conditioned units, each with its own private entrance. Every unit includes a desk, free Wi-Fi, microwave, fridge, tea and coffee facilities, and an en-suite bathroom, allowing guests to work or relax at their own pace.

Breakfast and dinner can be arranged when required. The property has easy access to major routes, medical facilities, and commercial hubs including Menlyn and Woodlands.
